@@ -0,0 +1,118 @@
+###############################################################################
+# Copyright (C) 2024 Habana Labs, Ltd. an Intel Company
+# All Rights Reserved.
+#
+# Unauthorized copying of this file or any element(s) within it, via any medium
+# is strictly prohibited.
